{"task_id": "HumanEval/47", "solution": "def median(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return median of elements in the list l.\n    >>> median([3, 1, 2, 4, 5])\n    3\n    >>> median([-10, 4, 6, 1000, 10, 20])\n    15.0\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_l = sorted(l)\n    n = len(sorted_l)\n    mid = n // 2\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        return sorted_l[mid]\n    else:\n        # According to doctest, for even length, median is average of elements at mid and mid+1 (0-indexed).\n        return (sorted_l[mid] + sorted_l[mid + 1]) / 2.0"}
